{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# gl(3), L=2, [3,2,0]⊗[3,2,0]: site-localizing transfer matrices and CG reconstruction\n\nThis is the [3,2,0] copy of `L2-310-localization-EH.wb`. The method, conventions and numeric point are the same, and the notes are in `L2-310-localization.md` and `L2-320-localization.md`.\n- **Rep.** The rep is Λ = [3,2,0] (dim 15). [2,1,0] is still run as the control in Sections 1–3.\n- **Code changes from the [3,1,0] notebook:**\n  - the rep;\n  - the expected scan hits;\n  - the list of local objects;\n  - the one-site fit, which now uses all components, since a 3-component fit is degenerate for T₍₁,₁₎ at [3,2,0].\n\n**Conventions.** The new conventions, with EH generators.\n- **Lax.** ℒ_ij(u) = uδ_ij + hEH_ij, and T = ℒ⁽¹⁾(u−θ₁)ℒ⁽²⁾(u−θ₂).\n- **Twist.** The t's carry the ket twist diag(z).\n- **Bra.** ⟨Ω| = ⟨Ω_zw|⊗⟨Ω_zw|.\n- **Fusion.** CBR, T_λ(u) = det t_{λ'_j+i−j}(u+(i−1)h).\n- **Numeric point.** h = 1/2, θ = (2/7,−3/5), z = (3/2,5/4,2/3), w = (5/2,7/3,3/5).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* fresh kernel state: this clears the other new-conventions notebooks' session state (their files are untouched) *)\nClearAll[\"Global`*\"];\n(* GT basis and gl(3) generators, verbatim from the clean L=1 notebook *)\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #1] &) /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse[Sort[res]], Reverse[Sort[Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[\n  k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n  l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n  l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];\nzeroQ[e_] := AllTrue[Union[Flatten[{e}]], PossibleZeroQ];\nchecks = <||>;\nhN = 1/2; thN = {2/7, -3/5}; zN = {3/2, 5/4, 2/3}; wN = {5/2, 7/3, 3/5}; nL = 2;\n(* EH generators for rep Λ: R = sqrt(M), M diagonal with M^-1.E_ij^T.M = E_ji, M_1 = 1 *)\nRdOf[Λ_] := RdOf[Λ] = Module[{Mv = Array[mm, dim[Λ]]}, Sqrt[Mv /. First[Solve[Join[Thread[DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Table[DiagonalMatrix[Mv] . JJ[j, i, Λ] - Transpose[JJ[i, j, Λ]] . DiagonalMatrix[Mv], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]]], 0] == 0], {mm[1] == 1}], Mv]]]];\nEH[Λ_][i_, j_] := EH[Λ][i, j] = DiagonalMatrix[RdOf[Λ]] . JJ[i, j, Λ] . DiagonalMatrix[1/RdOf[Λ]];\nwtBasis[Λ_] := wtBasis[Λ] = Flatten[Table[Table[J0[k][p1] + J0[k][p2], {k, 3}], {p1, ps[{Λ}]}, {p2, ps[{Λ}]}], 1];\nnu[Λ_, n_][x_] := Product[x - thN[[s]] + hN Λ[[n]], {s, nL}];\nqdet[Λ_][x_] := (Times @@ zN) nu[Λ, 1][x] nu[Λ, 2][x - hN] nu[Λ, 3][x - 2 hN];\n(* the rotated w-vacuum Ω_zw = e1^T e^{r1 E12} e^{r2 E13} e^{r3 E23}; r_i from the adjoint notebook (Section 4), re-checked for each rep below *)\nrOmF[zz_, ww_] := {(ww[[1]] - zz[[1]])/(ww[[1]] - zz[[2]]), ((ww[[1]] - zz[[1]]) (-ww[[2]] + zz[[1]]) (zz[[2]] - zz[[3]]))/((zz[[1]] - zz[[2]]) (ww[[1]] - zz[[3]]) (ww[[2]] - zz[[3]])), ((ww[[1]] - zz[[2]]) (-ww[[2]] + zz[[2]]) (zz[[1]] - zz[[3]]))/((zz[[1]] - zz[[2]]) (ww[[1]] - zz[[3]]) (-ww[[2]] + zz[[3]]))};\nnexpS[A_] := IdentityMatrix[Length[A]] + Sum[MatrixPower[A, k]/k!, {k, 1, Length[A]}];\nrN = rOmF[zN, wN];\nΩ1[Λ_] := Ω1[Λ] = UnitVector[dim[Λ], 1] . nexpS[rN[[1]] EH[Λ][1, 2]] . nexpS[rN[[2]] EH[Λ][1, 3]] . nexpS[rN[[3]] EH[Λ][2, 3]];\nchecks[\"EH^T = EH_ji for [2,1,0] and [3,2,0]\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[zeroQ[Transpose[EH[Λ][i, j]] - EH[Λ][j, i]], {Λ, {{2, 1, 0}, {3, 2, 0}}}, {i, 3}, {j, 3}]];\nchecks[\"gl(3) relations [E_ij,E_kl] = δ_jk E_il - δ_li E_kj for [3,2,0]\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[With[{E = EH[{3, 2, 0}]}, zeroQ[E[i, j] . E[k, l] - E[k, l] . E[i, j] - KroneckerDelta[j, k] E[i, l] + KroneckerDelta[l, i] E[k, j]]], {i, 3}, {j, 3}, {k, 3}, {l, 3}]];\nGrid[{{\"dim [3,2,0]\", dim[{3, 2, 0}]}, {\"R = sqrt(M) for [3,2,0]\", RdOf[{3, 2, 0}]}, {\"EH^T = EH_ji\", checks[\"EH^T = EH_ji for [2,1,0] and [3,2,0]\"]}, {\"gl(3) relations\", checks[\"gl(3) relations [E_ij,E_kl] = δ_jk E_il - δ_li E_kj for [3,2,0]\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
