  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. CBR scan at θ_s+ch (λ₁ ≤ 5, λ₃ = 0, c = −8..8)\nThe labels are as in the [3,1,0] notebook: **site 1** means C = vΩ_zwᵀ, **SITE 2** means C = Ω_zw vᵀ, **eig** means C ∝ Ω⊗Ω, and **0** means the covector vanishes. [2,1,0] is the control.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "tApplyN[Λ_, c_, a_, v_] := Which[c === 0, 0, a == 0, c, a == 3, qdet[Λ][v] c, a < 0 || a > 3, 0, True, c . tMN[Λ, Zn, a, v]];\nconj[λ_] := Table[Count[λ, x_ /; x >= j], {j, Max[λ]}];\n(* CBR det_{i,j} t_{λ'_j+i-j}(u+(i-1)h) acting on covector c0: row k takes column j ∉ S\\{j}; sign = # of used columns > j *)\ncbrN[Λ_, c0_, λ_, u_] := Module[{lc = conj[λ], n = Max[λ], dp},\n   dp[0, {}] = c0;\n   dp[k_, S_] := dp[k, S] = Total[Table[With[{a = lc[[j]] + k - j}, If[a < 0 || a > 3, 0, (-1)^Count[S, x_ /; x > j] tApplyN[Λ, dp[k - 1, DeleteCases[S, j]], a, u + (k - 1) hN]]], {j, S}]];\n   dp[n, Range[n]]];\nlocLabel[Λ_, c_] := Module[{d = dim[Λ], Ω = N[Ω1[Λ]], C, n},\n   If[c === 0, Return[\"0\"]]; C = Partition[c, d]; n = Norm[c];\n   Which[n < 10^-9 Norm[Ω2N[Λ]], \"0\",\n    Norm[Flatten[C - Outer[Times, Ω, Ω] (Ω . C . Ω)/(Ω . Ω)^2]]/n < 10^-8, \"eig\",\n    Norm[Flatten[C - Outer[Times, Ω, Ω . C/(Ω . Ω)]]]/n < 10^-8, \"SITE 2\",\n    Norm[Flatten[C - Outer[Times, C . Ω/(Ω . Ω), Ω]]]/n < 10^-8, \"site 1\",\n    True, \"·\"]];\nshapesS = Join[Table[{a}, {a, 5}], Flatten[Table[{a, b}, {a, 1, 5}, {b, 1, a}], 1]];\ncRange = Range[-8, 8];\n{scanT, scanCBR} = AbsoluteTiming[Association[Table[{Λ, s} -> Table[locLabel[Λ, cbrN[Λ, Ω2N[Λ], λ, thN[[s]] + cc hN]], {λ, shapesS}, {cc, cRange}], {Λ, {{2, 1, 0}, {3, 2, 0}}}, {s, 2}]]];\nhitsCBR[Λ_, s_] := Select[Flatten[Table[{shapesS[[i]], cRange[[j]], scanCBR[{Λ, s}][[i, j]]}, {i, Length[shapesS]}, {j, Length[cRange]}], 1], MemberQ[{\"site 1\", \"SITE 2\"}, #[[3]]] &];\nchecks[\"control [2,1,0]: CBR site-1 hits = T11, T21 at θ1-2h\"] = hitsCBR[{2, 1, 0}, 1] === {{{1, 1}, -2, \"site 1\"}, {{2, 1}, -2, \"site 1\"}};\nchecks[\"control [2,1,0]: CBR site-2 hits = T11 at θ2+h\"] = hitsCBR[{2, 1, 0}, 2] === {{{1, 1}, 1, \"SITE 2\"}};\nchecks[\"[3,2,0]: CBR site-1 hits = T11, T21, T31 at θ1-3h; site-2 = T11(θ2+h), T22(θ2)\"] = hitsCBR[{3, 2, 0}, 1] === {{{1, 1}, -3, \"site 1\"}, {{2, 1}, -3, \"site 1\"}, {{3, 1}, -3, \"site 1\"}} && hitsCBR[{3, 2, 0}, 2] === {{{1, 1}, 1, \"SITE 2\"}, {{2, 2}, 0, \"SITE 2\"}};\nGrid[Join[{{\"scan time (s)\", scanT}}, Flatten[Table[{{Λ, \"near θ\" <> ToString[s], \"hits {λ, c, label}:\", hitsCBR[Λ, s]}}, {Λ, {{2, 1, 0}, {3, 2, 0}}}, {s, 2}], 2]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
