rd text\"><span class=\"mord\">t</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.56em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6201em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.56em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.06em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.06em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.06em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.31em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.06em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.52em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.06em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9201em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.06em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.1201em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.06em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.56em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[228]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\Lambda  & \\text{site} & \\text{\\# local covectors at depth 0,1,2} & \\text{span rank \\{$\\Omega$, v\\} (cumulative)} & \\text{depth-1 products \\{\\{t, a, c\\}, \\{T, $\\lambda$, c\\}\\}}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,1,0\\right\\} & 1 & \\left\\{2,2,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,3,3\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{\\text{t},1,-1\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\text{T},\\left\\{1,1\\right\\},-2\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\text{t},2,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\text{T},\\left\\{2,1\\right\\},-2\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,1,0\\right\\} & 2 & \\left\\{1,1,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,3,3\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{\\text{t},1,-1\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\text{T},\\left\\{1,1\\right\\},1\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,2,0\\right\\} & 1 & \\left\\{3,2,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,4,4\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{\\text{t},1,-2\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\text{T},\\left\\{1,1\\right\\},-3\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\text{t},2,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\text{T},\\left\\{3,1\\right\\},-3\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,2,0\\right\\} & 2 & \\left\\{2,1,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,4,4\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{\\text{t},1,-2\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\text{T},\\left\\{2,2\\right\\},0\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{time (s)} & 0.083988 &  &  & \\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
