  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5. Reconstruction of the highest-weight CG states at small twist\nThe setup is as in `L2-310-localization-EH.wb` Section 5: z = e^{εφ} and w = e^{εω}, the same φ and ω (seed 5), and the normalization ⟨x₀|Ψ⟩ = 1.\n\n**Data rows:**\n- **site1:** T₍₁,₁₎, T₍₂,₁₎, T₍₃,₁₎ at θ₁−3h;\n- **site2:** t₂(θ₂+h), T₍₂,₂₎(θ₂), and T₍₂,₂₎(θ₂)·t₁(θ₂−2h);\n- **Ω:** the bare ⟨Ω(w)|.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Λ0 = {3, 2, 0}; d1 = dim[Λ0]; d2 = d1^2;\nφT = {1/3, -2/7, 5/11}; SeedRandom[5]; ωMany = Table[RandomInteger[{-40, 40}, 3]/RandomChoice[{7, 11, 13, 17}], 30];\nEHp[pr_][i_, j_] := EHp[pr][i, j] = N[EH[Λ0][i, j], pr];\nLaxP[pr_, s_, v_] := LaxP[pr, s, v] = Table[KroneckerDelta[a, b] (v - thN[[s]]) IdentityMatrix[d1] + hN EHp[pr][a, b], {a, 3}, {b, 3}];\ncTabP[pr_, C_, a_, l_, v_] := Sum[Transpose[LaxP[pr, 1, v][[a, k]]] . C . LaxP[pr, 2, v][[k, l]], {k, 3}];\nqdetZ[zE_][x_] := (Times @@ zE) nu[Λ0, 1][x] nu[Λ0, 2][x - hN] nu[Λ0, 3][x - 2 hN];\ntApplyP[pr_, zE_][C_, a_, v_] := Which[C === 0, 0, a == 0, C, a == 3, qdetZ[zE][v] C, a < 0 || a > 3, 0, True, Sum[Sum[Signature[σ] Fold[zE[[#2[[2]]]] cTabP[pr, #1, σ[[#2[[1]]]], #2[[2]], v - (#2[[1]] - 1) hN] &, C, Transpose[{Range[a], I}]], {σ, Permutations[I]}], {I, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}]];\nobjP[pr_, zE_, C0_, s_, fl_] := Fold[If[#2[[1]] === \"T\", cbrGen[tApplyP[pr, zE], #1, #2[[2]], thN[[s]] + #2[[3]] hN], tApplyP[pr, zE][#1, #2[[2]], thN[[s]] + #2[[3]] hN]] &, C0, fl];\nOm1P[pr_, zE_, wE_] := With[{rr = rOmF[zE, wE]}, UnitVector[d1, 1] . nexpS[rr[[1]] EHp[pr][1, 2]] . nexpS[rr[[2]] EHp[pr][1, 3]] . nexpS[rr[[3]] EHp[pr][2, 3]]];\nsite1Ops = {{{\"T\", {1, 1}, -3}}, {{\"T\", {2, 1}, -3}}, {{\"T\", {3, 1}, -3}}};\nsite2Ops = {{{\"t\", 2, 1}}, {{\"T\", {2, 2}, 0}}, {{\"T\", {2, 2}, 0}, {\"t\", 1, -2}}};\nlocRes[s_, C_, Ω_] := Norm[Flatten[If[s == 1, C - Outer[Times, C . Ω/(Ω . Ω), Ω], C - Outer[Times, Ω, Ω . C/(Ω . Ω)]]]]/Norm[Flatten[C]];\ncovFamP[eps_, ωs_, pr_] := Module[{zE = N[Exp[eps φT], pr]}, Table[Module[{Ω = Om1P[pr, zE, N[Exp[eps ωv], pr]], C0, c1, c2},\n     C0 = Outer[Times, Ω, Ω]; c1 = objP[pr, zE, C0, 1, #] & /@ site1Ops; c2 = objP[pr, zE, C0, 2, #] & /@ site2Ops;\n     <|\"site1\" -> (Flatten /@ c1), \"site2\" -> (Flatten /@ c2), \"Ω\" -> {Flatten[C0]}, \"loc\" -> Max[Join[locRes[1, #, Ω] & /@ c1, locRes[2, #, Ω] & /@ c2]]|>], {ωv, ωs}]];\nx0P[eps_, pr_] := Module[{zE = N[Exp[eps φT], pr], rsE, Pph}, rsE = rsSol /. Thread[zs -> zE];\n   Pph = nexpS[(r[1] /. rsE) EHp[pr][3, 2]] . nexpS[(r[2] /. rsE) EHp[pr][3, 1]] . nexpS[(r[3] /. rsE) EHp[pr][2, 1]] . DiagonalMatrix[Table[Product[(s[k] /. rsE)^J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ0}]}]] . nexpS[(1/zE[[1]]) EHp[pr][1, 2]] . nexpS[-(1/(zE[[1]] zE[[2]])) EHp[pr][1, 3]] . nexpS[((zE[[1]] + zE[[2]])/(zE[[1]] zE[[2]])) EHp[pr][2, 3]];\n   Flatten[KroneckerProduct[#, #]] &[UnitVector[d1, 1] . Inverse[Pph]]];\n(* eigenstates: sparse two-site monodromy with the twist on the right *)\nTmSp[pr_, zE_, v_] := Table[Sum[KroneckerProduct[SparseArray[LaxP[pr, 1, v][[i, k]]], SparseArray[LaxP[pr, 2, v][[k, j]]]], {k, 3}] zE[[j]], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\nmixSp[pr_, zE_] := Module[{v = 3/7, A, B}, A = TmSp[pr, zE, v]; B = TmSp[pr, zE, v - hN]; Sum[A[[i, i]], {i, 3}] + N[Pi, pr] Sum[A[[i, i]] . B[[j, j]] - A[[j, i]] . B[[i, j]], {i, 3}, {j, i + 1, 3}]];\nRRd = Flatten[Outer[Times, RdOf[Λ0], RdOf[Λ0]]];\nEtotJ[i_, j_] := EtotJ[i, j] = SparseArray[KroneckerProduct[JJ[i, j, Λ0], IdentityMatrix[d1]] + KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[d1], JJ[i, j, Λ0]]];\nwtB = wtBasis[Λ0];\nhwBJ[μ_] := hwBJ[μ] = With[{sec = Flatten[Position[wtB, μ]]}, Table[Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> n], {d2}]], {n, NullSpace[Normal[Join[EtotJ[1, 2][[All, sec]], EtotJ[2, 3][[All, sec]]]]]}]];\nhwSecs = Select[Union[wtB], Length[hwBJ[#]] > 0 &];\n(* EH-basis HW kets = (R⊗R) x E-basis HW kets *)\nhwB[μ_] := hwB[μ] = Orthogonalize[N[RRd # & /@ hwBJ[μ], 250]];\nhwRes[ψ_] := With[{ψE = ψ/RRd}, (Norm[EtotJ[1, 2] . ψE] + Norm[EtotJ[2, 3] . ψE])/Norm[ψE]];\npsiStatesP[eps_, pr_] := Module[{zE = N[Exp[eps φT], pr], mix, x0, out = {}}, mix = mixSp[pr, zE]; x0 = x0P[eps, pr];\n   Do[With[{sec = Flatten[Position[wtB, μ]]}, With[{es = Eigensystem[Normal[mix[[sec, sec]]]]}, Do[With[{ψ0 = Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> es[[2, k]]], {d2}]]}, If[hwRes[ψ0] < 10^-3, AppendTo[out, <|\"mu\" -> μ, \"ev\" -> es[[1, k]], \"ψ\" -> ψ0/(x0 . ψ0)|>]]], {k, Length[sec]}]]], {μ, hwSecs}];\n   SortBy[out, {Position[hwSecs, #[\"mu\"]][[1, 1]], Re[#[\"ev\"]]} &]];\nrankTol[m_, tol_] := With[{sv = SingularValueList[m, Tolerance -> 0]}, Count[sv, x_ /; x > tol First[sv]]];\nfamList = {{\"site1\"}, {\"site1\", \"Ω\"}, {\"site2\"}, {\"site2\", \"Ω\"}, {\"site1\", \"site2\"}, {\"site1\", \"site2\", \"Ω\"}};\nrows[cf_, fam_, sec_] := Flatten[Table[Flatten[c /@ fam, 1], {c, cf}], 1][[All, sec]];\nrankFamP[eps_, ωs_, pr_] := Module[{cf = covFamP[eps, ωs, pr], x0 = x0P[eps, pr]},\n   {Max[cf[[All, \"loc\"]]], Table[With[{sec = Flatten[Position[wtB, μ]]}, Join[{μ, Length[sec]}, Table[rankTol[Append[rows[cf, f, sec], x0[[sec]]], 10^-40], {f, famList}]]], {μ, hwSecs}]}];\nreconP[eps_, ωs_, pr_, fam_] := Module[{sts = psiStatesP[eps, pr], cf = covFamP[eps, ωs, pr], x0 = x0P[eps, pr]},\n   Table[With[{μ = st[\"mu\"], sec = Flatten[Position[wtB, st[\"mu\"]]]}, Module[{M, ψt, ψr, hb},\n       M = Append[rows[cf, fam, sec], x0[[sec]]]; ψt = st[\"ψ\"][[sec]]; ψr = LeastSquares[M, M . ψt]; hb = hwB[μ][[All, sec]];\n       {μ, Length[sec], rankTol[M, 10^-80], N[Norm[ψr - ψt]/Norm[ψt], 3], N[Norm[hb . ψr - hb . ψt]/Norm[hb . ψt], 3]}]], {st, sts}]];\n{rkT, {locR, rkR}} = AbsoluteTiming[rankFamP[1/3, ωMany[[1 ;; 20]], 80]];\nchecks[\"[3,2,0]: localization holds at ε=1/3 for 20 w (max rel. resid)\"] = locR;\nGrid[Join[{{\"max locality residual, ε = 1/3, 20 w\", ScientificForm[N[locR, 3], 3], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, Join[{\"μ\", \"dim\"}, StringRiffle[#, \"+\"] & /@ famList]}, rkR, {{\"time (s)\", rkT}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758597\" data-output-id=\"314\" data-out-n=\"281\" data-sub-idx=\"33\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"11\" data-sub-start=\"43\" data-sub-end=\"43\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[281]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:13.24em;vertical-align:-6.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:13.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-6.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max locality residual, </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mord\"> = 1/3, 20 w</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"m