      {
       "data": "Out[310]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{contour time (s)} & 72.214891 & \\text{resum check at $\\varepsilon$=1/40} & \\text{0.}\\times 10^{\\text{-17}} & \\text{x0 \\textasciitilde{} $\\varepsilon$\\^{}4} & \\\\\\hline\\mu  & \\text{mult} & \\text{dim} & \\text{k ($\\Psi$ \\textasciitilde{} $\\varepsilon$\\^{}-k)} & \\text{\\{N\\_min, log10 gap\\}: $\\psi$0 $\\in$ HW\\_$\\mu$ prior} & \\text{\\{N\\_min, log10 gap\\}: no prior}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,3,3\\right\\} & 1 & 18 & \\left\\{9\\right\\} & \\left\\{5,-\\infty \\right\\} & \\left\\{5,-\\infty \\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,4,2\\right\\} & 1 & 14 & \\left\\{8\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,-\\infty \\right\\} & \\left\\{2,-\\infty \\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{5,3,2\\right\\} & 2 & 10 & \\left\\{7\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,-\\infty \\right\\} & \\left\\{2,-\\infty \\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{5,4,1\\right\\} & 2 & 6 & \\left\\{6\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,-\\infty \\right\\} & \\left\\{1,-\\infty \\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{5,5,0\\right\\} & 1 & 2 & \\left\\{5\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,-\\infty \\right\\} & \\left\\{1,-\\infty \\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{6,2,2\\right\\} & 1 & 3 & \\left\\{6\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,-\\infty \\right\\} & \\left\\{2,-\\infty \\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{6,3,1\\right\\} & 1 & 2 & \\left\\{5\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,-\\infty \\right\\} & \\left\\{1,-\\infty \\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{6,4,0\\r… [latex truncated: 1355 chars total]",
